@startuml
title CloudNotes -- CI/CD and Observability Workflow
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor Developer
cloud "GitHub Repository" as github
component "GitHub Push Webhook" as webhook
component "Jenkins Pipeline" as jenkins
database "Docker Hub Image Registry" as registry
node "AWS Application EC2" {
  component "K3s / kubectl" as cluster
  component "CloudNotes Pods" as pods
  component "Prometheus" as prometheus
  component "Grafana Dashboard\nrefresh: 5 s" as grafana
}
Developer --> github : git push
github --> webhook
webhook --> jenkins : trigger build
jenkins --> jenkins : checkout, tests\nsecret scan, image scan
jenkins --> registry : build and push tagged images
jenkins --> cluster : SSH + kubectl apply\nset image + rollout status
registry --> pods : image pull
pods --> prometheus : expose /metrics
prometheus --> grafana : PromQL queries
grafana --> Developer : live metrics and analysis
note bottom of jenkins
GitHub Actions is not used.
end note
@enduml
